WEBVTT

00:16.224 --> 00:21.438
The volcano has just erupted.

00:22.188 --> 00:27.652
Everyone in the surrounding areas
should evacuate immediately.

00:28.653 --> 00:32.657
Please prioritize your lives.

00:33.450 --> 00:38.038
The volcano has just erupted.

00:42.083 --> 00:44.502
That's why I told you!

00:44.586 --> 00:47.505
Because we kept offering sacrifices,

00:47.589 --> 00:53.887
the Great Serpent Lord protected
this land from the volcano!

00:57.182 --> 00:59.350
But it's all over now.

00:59.434 --> 01:01.853
The Great Serpent Lord has passed away.

01:01.936 --> 01:04.272
All because of you!

01:06.816 --> 01:09.569
"Dragon rising to heaven
will cast a rainbow,

01:09.652 --> 01:12.530
and the wrath of the mountain
will engulf the village."

01:12.614 --> 01:15.909
It's just like the legend
that's been passed down in this village!

01:15.992 --> 01:19.412
How are you going to take responsibility
for all this, damn you?

01:19.496 --> 01:21.122
Damn it!

01:23.708 --> 01:25.168
Strange.

01:25.710 --> 01:29.088
Earthworms can't be in the sun.

01:29.172 --> 01:33.092
Then why is there a legend
of a dragon rising to heaven?

01:33.176 --> 01:35.136
Hey, you listening?

01:35.220 --> 01:36.554
Damn it!

01:37.472 --> 01:38.640
That's not it.

01:38.723 --> 01:40.934
The legend isn't about
the Great Serpent at all!

01:41.476 --> 01:44.229
The "dragon rising to heaven"
is a fountain!

01:45.563 --> 01:50.401
That fountain was a sign
that the volcano was going to erupt.

01:50.485 --> 01:52.821
People in the past knew.

01:52.904 --> 01:55.949
That's why they left it behind
as a legend!

01:57.659 --> 02:01.663
Though, its interpretation got warped
somewhere along the way!

02:04.541 --> 02:07.585
People who are robbed
of logical thinking due to fear

02:07.669 --> 02:10.839
can believe in and even execute
human sacrifices.

02:10.922 --> 02:13.424
So we don't repeat such sins,

02:13.508 --> 02:16.970
I take the time
and tell visitors of this tale.

02:17.929 --> 02:19.264
Ya wanna fight?

02:19.347 --> 02:21.474
I'll hold you responsible for this!

02:21.558 --> 02:23.601
You will be our human sacrifice!

02:23.685 --> 02:27.355
Oh hell no! I'm not taking
responsibility for anything!

02:27.438 --> 02:29.566
Human sacrifices...

02:30.316 --> 02:31.776
can suck it!

02:40.910 --> 02:42.287
You bitch!

02:42.370 --> 02:45.623
How dare you do that
to the corpse of the Great Serpent Lord!

02:46.583 --> 02:48.376
Wait, damn you!

02:48.459 --> 02:50.211
Get back here!

02:53.172 --> 02:54.632
Outta my way!

02:54.716 --> 02:57.093
Don't you dare try to run!

02:57.594 --> 02:59.345
You little turd!

03:12.901 --> 03:17.113
I won't let anyone insult
the Great Serpent Lord any longer!

03:22.702 --> 03:26.539
KEEP OUT

03:27.123 --> 03:28.541
And, there!

03:34.130 --> 03:36.090
Water main, check!

03:39.260 --> 03:40.762
There she is! Over there!

03:40.845 --> 03:42.388
Get her!

03:47.685 --> 03:50.980
If that magma swallows up this village,

03:51.064 --> 03:53.650
the Great Serpent legend
will become reality!

03:54.359 --> 03:59.280
I won't let such
a crappy legend become true!

04:14.671 --> 04:18.925
An earthworm is one big tube
from mouth to butt!

04:19.008 --> 04:22.929
All right, let's do this!

04:23.012 --> 04:25.431
Start the water spray!

06:15.666 --> 06:17.210
Here it comes!

06:17.293 --> 06:19.003
Hell yeah!

06:29.555 --> 06:31.057
All right!

06:31.808 --> 06:34.977
That earthworm's slime is working great!

06:38.314 --> 06:40.858
But the affected area is too huge!

06:41.442 --> 06:44.237
Wouldn't the wildfire be
more dangerous than the magma?

06:54.455 --> 06:55.331
Damn you!

06:56.415 --> 06:57.625
That was close!

06:57.708 --> 07:00.795
Don't you dare insult
the Great Serpent Lord any longer!

07:00.878 --> 07:04.757
I'm trying to stop the lava.
Don't get in my way!

07:04.841 --> 07:07.677
We're the ones who've been
protecting this land!

07:07.760 --> 07:10.263
Outsiders should stay out of it!

07:10.346 --> 07:16.060
I'll make you a human sacrifice
and quell the Lord Volcano's wrath!

07:16.978 --> 07:19.272
Wait, you changed your god?

07:19.355 --> 07:21.357
You don't care about
the Great Serpent Lord anymore?

07:21.441 --> 07:23.734
Shut up, moron!

07:36.456 --> 07:40.668
Oh my, I didn't think
you were Master's grandchild.

07:40.751 --> 07:42.712
I am terribly sorry.

07:43.546 --> 07:46.215
The priest who wants to become a BooTuber!

07:46.299 --> 07:47.258
Hey there.

07:48.634 --> 07:51.596
Actually, one week ago, Master...

07:51.679 --> 07:55.516
Three young'uns are headed your way,
so watch over them, will ya?

07:55.600 --> 07:56.684
Huh? Who--

07:58.769 --> 08:01.063
That's what she told me.

08:01.147 --> 08:03.024
Master? Wait a sec...

08:03.816 --> 08:06.110
Man, I wanna be a BooTuber.

08:06.903 --> 08:10.364
In the past week, the only person
who visited our shrine

08:10.448 --> 08:13.367
was a girl who liked tsuchinokos.

08:13.451 --> 08:15.661
So I thought she was just a tourist.

08:16.245 --> 08:17.622
Please notice.

08:17.705 --> 08:19.999
Bastard priest!

08:20.082 --> 08:22.543
I knew I didn't like you.

08:22.627 --> 08:25.463
But I didn't know you
were in cahoots with that bitch!

08:25.546 --> 08:29.592
Leave them to me,
and focus on putting out the fire!

08:31.427 --> 08:33.679
Got it! Thanks!

08:35.890 --> 08:37.808
Come on!

08:39.644 --> 08:43.189
Crap! It feels heavier than earlier!

08:48.069 --> 08:51.447
I don't know when I'll run outta gas.

08:51.531 --> 08:55.284
I can't suddenly collapse
like I did before!

08:58.287 --> 09:00.581
No way! What is it this time?

09:15.263 --> 09:16.222
Jiji!

09:26.315 --> 09:27.984
Jiji! Don't!

09:46.752 --> 09:47.878
Are you okay?

09:50.172 --> 09:54.385
Damn you, scurrying about
and getting in the way.

09:54.969 --> 09:58.014
Maybe I'll kill you off first.

09:58.097 --> 10:00.266
If you keep going, they'll die!

10:00.349 --> 10:02.852
I don't want to make Jiji a murderer!

10:04.353 --> 10:06.314
Wait, where's Okarun?

10:06.897 --> 10:08.190
What did you do with him?

10:08.774 --> 10:13.446
I will only talk about what I want to.

10:13.529 --> 10:16.198
I am hungry.

10:17.825 --> 10:20.536
I didn't think things
would turn out like this.

10:20.620 --> 10:22.121
That guy is bad news!

10:22.204 --> 10:23.998
He's too much for me to handle.

10:24.081 --> 10:27.043
It's all your fault, you hear?

10:27.126 --> 10:29.754
You brought in all this trouble!

10:29.837 --> 10:31.464
Shut up!

10:31.547 --> 10:34.675
This ain't the time
to whine about this and that!

10:35.843 --> 10:37.303
We gotta do this!

10:44.268 --> 10:45.353
Get down!

10:57.573 --> 11:00.576
Jennifer Lopez Anaconda!

11:09.126 --> 11:10.086
Priest!

11:12.963 --> 11:15.966
Daisetsuzan Drop!

11:23.015 --> 11:24.433
Got him!

11:29.271 --> 11:30.689
Ouch!

11:47.039 --> 11:48.040
It's not coming out!

12:13.774 --> 12:16.861
Are you all right, Miss Momo Ayase?

12:18.070 --> 12:18.946
What?

12:20.072 --> 12:21.907
Mantisian?

12:21.991 --> 12:24.118
I came here to help!

12:24.201 --> 12:26.203
Why are you here? What about your son?

12:26.287 --> 12:27.788
Can I tell you later?

12:35.463 --> 12:37.131
Damn, this thing's slow!

12:37.840 --> 12:42.136
Descending from the heavens
We're children of the stars

12:42.219 --> 12:43.053
Wha...

12:43.137 --> 12:45.598
Embracing all
Let us go to the end of...

12:45.681 --> 12:47.892
Install an elevator next time!

12:49.768 --> 12:52.062
I'm floating! So scary!

12:52.646 --> 12:55.065
You're a man! Quit your whining!

12:55.149 --> 12:57.985
...Descending from the heavens...

12:58.068 --> 13:00.029
Hurry and get me down!

13:00.112 --> 13:01.572
Grandma?

13:01.655 --> 13:06.410
...Embracing all
Let us go to the end of the universe...

13:06.494 --> 13:08.537
This is a pain in the ass.

13:08.621 --> 13:09.580
...Seiko!

13:09.663 --> 13:10.789
Damn it.

13:10.873 --> 13:12.416
...Taro!

13:13.501 --> 13:17.922
Let's all look up at the stars

13:18.005 --> 13:22.134
See? Now we've all become friends

13:22.968 --> 13:29.099
Fly away, fly away
All the way beyond the sky

13:29.183 --> 13:34.855
Our shooting star carrying all our wishes

13:34.939 --> 13:40.110
Fly away, fly away
To the end of the universe

13:40.194 --> 13:41.278
Our shooting star...

13:41.362 --> 13:42.613
Master!

13:42.696 --> 13:43.781
Manjiro!

13:45.074 --> 13:46.408
The Tokami Emitame!

13:46.492 --> 13:47.826
Yes'm!

13:47.910 --> 13:49.912
Taro, charge on my command!

13:49.995 --> 13:51.830
Okay!

13:52.414 --> 13:53.707
Let's go, Kappa!

14:37.835 --> 14:38.586
Taro!

14:44.425 --> 14:46.552
All right!

15:19.418 --> 15:23.088
PEACEFUL PROSPEROUS FAMILY
WARD AGAINST EVIL AND MISFORTUNE

16:01.543 --> 16:02.836
Captured it.

16:05.047 --> 16:06.173
Let's go home.

16:12.388 --> 16:18.310
Fly away, fly away
Cold, hot springs furikake

16:19.019 --> 16:23.565
Crash land on our home planet

16:23.649 --> 16:28.779
Keep going, keep on going
As far as you can go

16:28.862 --> 16:34.326
A flying star carrying a big corpse

16:34.410 --> 16:37.454
Daddy, is this okay?

16:38.038 --> 16:44.628
Well done, Chiquitita!
Keep going and put out the fires!

16:48.257 --> 16:50.634
I told you beforehand.

16:50.718 --> 16:54.013
And you left it alone
until it got this bad, damn it!

16:54.096 --> 16:55.264
My apologies!

16:55.347 --> 16:58.100
Your communication was sloppy
to begin with, Master!

16:58.809 --> 17:02.479
I'd like you to praise me for helping
with only that much to go on!

17:02.563 --> 17:04.857
You're not half bad.

17:04.940 --> 17:05.816
Thanks!

17:05.899 --> 17:09.028
And you need to be kind
to the stray model, too.

17:09.111 --> 17:12.322
We were able to seal it away
thanks to Taro.

17:12.406 --> 17:14.533
I didn't hear anything about this!

17:14.616 --> 17:16.744
What are you gonna do
about my internal organs?

17:16.827 --> 17:19.788
You can just toss those
into a grocery store bag or something.

17:19.872 --> 17:22.583
Hey, Momo. What happened
to four-eyes and the cat?

17:22.666 --> 17:23.876
Huh?

17:23.959 --> 17:26.503
Looks like Miss Momo isn't around.

17:35.637 --> 17:39.600
You need to escape first
so you can save us!

17:46.815 --> 17:47.649
There it is!

17:49.109 --> 17:51.445
Crap, I can't draw out my psychic powers!

17:51.528 --> 17:54.573
Miss Ayase, stand back!

18:03.332 --> 18:04.750
Okarun!

18:26.688 --> 18:29.441
Miss Ayase, this might...

18:32.861 --> 18:34.238
No way.

18:40.994 --> 18:42.204
No...

18:43.330 --> 18:45.165
This can't be...

18:53.257 --> 18:56.802
Chiquitita! Put that slime into the magma!

18:56.885 --> 18:59.763
Miss Ayase, what do you intend to do?

18:59.847 --> 19:00.973
I'm going in!

19:01.056 --> 19:03.642
You can't! It's dangerous!

19:03.725 --> 19:05.727
If you did that, you would also...

19:05.811 --> 19:08.272
I would also what?

19:08.355 --> 19:10.440
I promised to save him!

19:10.524 --> 19:12.442
Okarun is waiting for me!

19:12.526 --> 19:14.069
Please wait!

19:14.153 --> 19:17.865
I won't put this slime in the magma.

19:18.448 --> 19:22.369
There's no need for you
to enter the magma.

19:22.452 --> 19:25.414
You don't have to die in vain.

19:27.124 --> 19:29.751
Why would you say something like that?

19:30.377 --> 19:31.962
Hurry up and do it!

19:32.045 --> 19:34.673
- Miss Ayase, it's dangerous!
- You tell him too, Mantisian!

19:34.756 --> 19:38.302
Hurry! Please! I'm begging you!

19:38.385 --> 19:40.929
Save Okarun!

20:13.921 --> 20:16.340
Not hot!

20:16.423 --> 20:20.302
At all!

20:32.981 --> 20:34.358
Miss Ayase.

20:36.526 --> 20:38.362
I believed in you...

20:39.154 --> 20:41.031
That you'd save me.

20:45.160 --> 20:47.412
Hot!

20:47.496 --> 20:49.081
Turd nuggets!

20:49.873 --> 20:52.626
You took your sweet little time
with the rescue, moron!

20:52.709 --> 20:55.837
- You're a useless moron!
- Turbo Granny! I forgot about you!

20:55.921 --> 21:00.759
If I hadn't tried to save Turbo Granny,
I might've been dead by now.

21:04.471 --> 21:05.847
The area around the room...

21:05.931 --> 21:09.434
was protected by
the Mongolian Death Worm's mucus.

21:09.518 --> 21:12.396
It held back the magma from entering.

21:14.273 --> 21:16.275
That's right! Where's Mr. Jiji?

21:16.358 --> 21:18.068
He's not in the magma, right?

21:18.151 --> 21:19.695
It's fine.

21:20.404 --> 21:24.783
I don't know how,
but he got outside on his own.

21:25.409 --> 21:27.577
I-Is that so?

21:29.496 --> 21:30.539
I'm sorry.

21:31.081 --> 21:36.670
I said that I would handle Mr. Jiji,
but I couldn't do anything after all.

21:47.139 --> 21:49.474
I'm sorry! That wasn't on purpose!

21:50.058 --> 21:51.476
I'll back away immediately...

21:59.067 --> 22:01.528
I'm the one who should be sorry.

22:03.530 --> 22:05.824
I told you that I'd save you.

22:08.035 --> 22:10.203
But I couldn't do anything.

22:13.457 --> 22:15.125
Thank goodness...

22:16.543 --> 22:18.045
you're alive.

23:53.557 --> 23:58.103
Chi-Chiquitita, Chi-Chiquitita
Chi-Chiquitita

23:58.186 --> 23:59.855
Chiquitita, do you have a dream?

23:59.938 --> 24:04.568
Chi-Chiquitita, Chi-Chi-Chiquitita
Chi-Chi-Chiquitita

24:04.651 --> 24:07.988
-There's another episode, deez!
- Sh-Shy my chotchiki for you, Chiqui--
